@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1
@token = GANTI_DENGAN_TOKEN_LOGIN
@lapanganId = 1
@transaksiId = 1
@pembayaranId = 1

### Status API
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Login akun demo pelanggan
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "dani",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Daftar lapangan
GET {{baseUrl}}/venues
Accept: application/json

### Jadwal lapangan (ganti ke tanggal mendatang)
GET {{baseUrl}}/venues/{{lapanganId}}/schedule?tanggal=2026-12-10
Accept: application/json

### Membuat booking lapangan (perlu token pelanggan)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/venues
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lapangan_id": 1,
  "tanggal": "2026-12-10",
  "jam_mulai": "10:00",
  "durasi_jam": 2,
  "nama_penyewa": "Dani Raja Hutan",
  "no_hp_penyewa": "081234567890",
  "email_penyewa": "dani@sibora.local",
  "catatan": "Booking uji coba"
}

### Sewa peralatan (perlu token pelanggan)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/equipment-rentals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tanggal_sewa": "2026-12-10",
  "waktu_mulai": "10:00",
  "durasi_jam": 2,
  "nama_penyewa": "Dani Raja Hutan",
  "no_hp_penyewa": "081234567890",
  "email_penyewa": "dani@sibora.local",
  "items": [
    { "peralatan_id": 1, "jumlah": 2 }
  ]
}

### Membuat permintaan pembayaran
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transaksiId}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "metode": "qris" }

### Konfirmasi pembayaran DEMO (hanya APP_ENV=local)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{pembayaranId}}/mock-confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Riwayat booking
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Laporan pendapatan (role admin/pengelola)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/revenue?tahun=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
